    <body>
      <div type="clause" n="75.1">
        <head><ref type="lawCode" target="law:Af">Af</ref> 75.1</head>
        <ab type="selectedText" xml:lang="und">Gif se mon healt sie for þære sinwe wunde, ⁊ hine mon gelacnian ne mæge, geselle XXX scill to bote.</ab>
        <ab type="translation" xml:lang="en">If the man is lame due to the wound to the sinew, and he cannot be healed, let him pay 30 shillings as compensation.</ab>
        <ab type="secondTranslation" xml:lang="en">If a man becomes lame as a result of the damage to the sinew, and if he cannot be cured, 30 shillings shall be given to him [as compensation].</ab>
        <ab type="supplementaryText" xml:lang="und">Gif se mon healt sy for ðære sinwe wunde, ⁊ hine mon gelacnian ne mæge, gesylle XXX scll' to bote.</ab>
      </div>
